    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601702/2006017020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『あ、咲耶。急に電話しちゃってごめんな\r\n今、大丈夫か？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006017020180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "構わないよ\r\nついさっき、友達を見送ったところだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601702/2006017020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『ああ、そうか……！\r\n今日だったよな、会うの』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006017020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うん。とても楽しかった\r\n──それで、何かあったの？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601702/2006017020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『うん。この間打ち合わせした\r\nバス旅番組の件なんだけど────』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
